  <p>Quadratic equations are a fundamental topic in mathematics and are frequently tested in the NDA, CDS, and AFCAT exams. Over the years, these exams have included a variety of questions on quadratic equations, ranging from straightforward applications of the quadratic formula to more complex problems involving the manipulation of quadratic expressions and the analysis of their graphs.</p>

